Arara Code: start screen with clickable shortcuts in the empty editor area.

Replaces the editor watermark with sections (Começar, Navegar, Arara IA,
Personalizar). Each entry is a button that runs the command and shows its
keybinding. Entries whose command is not registered are hidden (re-renders
when extensions register commands, e.g. git.clone, arara.signIn).

Why a patch: the watermark is core workbench UI with no extension API.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/editor/editorGroupWatermark.ts,
         src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/editor/media/editorgroupview.css

